# LLM oracle transcripts are non-deterministic RUN ARTIFACTS, not golden
# fixtures (WR-93-04). They are regenerated by `go test -tags=llm ./test/oracle/llm/...`
# and consumed by the offline judge (`go test -tags=llmjudge ./test/oracle/judge/...`).
# Ignore everything in this directory except this file and the .gitkeep that
# keeps the (otherwise empty) directory tracked.
*
!.gitignore
!.gitkeep
